# b9-aggressive.hosts: Lumen's custom block list for Glasshouse on the B9
# (OLED55B9PUA, webOS 4.10.2, US). Upload it in the dashboard's custom
# blocking ("add" mode) or with tools/glasshouse-custom.sh. Glasshouse takes
# hosts-format lines (a sinkhole address, then the name), at most 10,000 names.
#
# STATUS: CANDIDATES ONLY. Every entry below is commented out. Each comes from
# public LG blocking research, not from this TV. Uncomment an entry only when
# the 24 h capture (tools/capture/summarize.py, "candidate" rows) shows the
# TV contacting it and it is not on allowlist.txt. Confirm with capture.
#
# tools/store-safe-check.sh checks every UNcommented entry is sinkholed and
# that none of them is on allowlist.txt.
#
# Costs of the categories, accepted by the owner on 2026-10-20: voice search,
# the ThinQ app and LG Channels stop working.

